BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:An Intuitive\, Extensible Open OnDemand Dashboard for Job Accounti
 ng and Performance Metrics - Richie Tan [Purdue]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T172000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T173000
DTSTAMP:20261020T211456Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-PKB37G@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:High-performance computing allows researchers across the globe
  to conduct research at scale. At Purdue University\, Open OnDemand provid
 es an easy way for users to access cluster resources and launch popular ap
 plications with minimal barriers. In order to improve how users interact w
 ith clusters\, we are building a user-friendly\, modular web dashboard on 
 Open OnDemand with detailed\, organized cluster information and color-code
 d visualizations. By combining Slurm-based data sources and modular widget
 s and components\, this dashboard allows researchers to access cluster inf
 ormation about their jobs and allocations easily and provides a modular\, 
 extensible framework to install on any Slurm-based cluster.
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/PKB37G/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
